{"data":[{"author_id":"1378320364376219655","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:41:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112388587584934088"],"id":"2112388587584934088","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1625,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"央行9月金融数据整体喜忧参半。社融同比多增，企业中长期贷款改善，政策托底效果显现，但居民房贷、消费贷款依旧偏弱。M2维持9.3%，市场流动性充足，M1增速低迷，居民存款单月大增，大家存钱意愿很强，内需内生动力不足。LPR下调压低融资成本，资金真正流入实体还需要时间。债市偏利好，股市要看盈利兑","url":"https://x.com/WangNextDoor2/status/2112388587584934088"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111986311108435968"]},"author_id":"976415723873492992","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:03:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111986512367927510"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Kye2PYPPg8","end":88,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/zcswl7961/status/2111986512367927510/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111986311108435968","start":65,"url":"https://t.co/Kye2PYPPg8"}]},"id":"2111986512367927510","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"国家统计局上午九点半会 发布九月份的关键数据\n重点关注社融，固投和房地产的相关数据\n主流的证券机构普遍认为9月份社融的数据会更差 https://t.co/Kye2PYPPg8","url":"https://x.com/zcswl7961/status/2111986512367927510"},{"author_id":"1006082493659746304","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:11:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111988695347908806"],"id":"2111988695347908806","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":35,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"9 月金融数据有个关键信号，很多人没注意到：\n前三季度，债券 + 股票融资占社融增量的 49.48%，超过银行贷款占比约 7 个百分点。\n中国金融体系正在换引擎。这意味着什么？","url":"https://x.com/tuscan_moon/status/2111988695347908806"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112374222110777344"]},"author_id":"1749453907703767040","created_at":"2026-10-20T02:43:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112374232965697858"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/kWISuf5XvS","end":164,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ChinaMacroFacts/status/2112374232965697858/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112374222110777344","start":141,"url":"https://t.co/kWISuf5XvS"},{"display_url":"x.com/chinamacrofact…","end":188,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/chinamacrofacts/status/1803610877335093277","start":165,"url":"https://t.co/GGkqnaNhYS"}]},"id":"2112374232965697858","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":58,"impression_count":34046,"like_count":103,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":15},"text":"时隔两年多，潘功胜终于完成了货币政策框架上从数量型到价格型的阶段性里程碑。\n\n这个框架的转变是制度性的，不应期待对货币政策有直接的短期的影响，属于与全球主要央行的操作框架接轨。\n\n未来货币政策将不再给出社融和基础货币供应的的目标区间，长期看房贷可能也将逐渐和国债接轨—和美国一致。 https://t.co/kWISuf5XvS https://t.co/GGkqnaNhYS","url":"https://x.com/ChinaMacroFacts/status/2112374232965697858"},{"author_id":"2028370185892278272","created_at":"2026-10-19T11:40:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112146745933148625"],"id":"2112146745933148625","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":151,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Busy week ahead!\n\nToday: China Q3 GDP (consensus 4.4% y/y) and Canada CPI. Tuesday: PBoC LPR, expected unchanged at 3.00% for a 17th month, plus UK jobs, German ZEW and US housing starts. Thursday: CBRT and BoK, both expected to hold. The Fed is in blackout before the Oct 27 to","url":"https://x.com/MilelePrime/status/2112146745933148625"},{"author_id":"1796323617036234752","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:36:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112387415151173917"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":19,"start":4,"tag":"monetarypolicy"},{"end":26,"start":20,"tag":"China"},{"end":32,"start":27,"tag":"PBoC"}]},"id":"2112387415151173917","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"❗️🇨🇳#monetarypolicy #China #PBoC China: 1Y LPR = 3% (exp./prev. 3%), 5Y LPR = 3.50% (exp./prev. 3.50%)\n\nRates unchanged for the 17th straight month.\n\nNo surprise: Beijing still prefers targeted support over broad cuts, and a firm yuan leaves room to ease later.","url":"https://x.com/KevinMorr1s/status/2112387415151173917"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112254865946611712"]},"author_id":"1305905708018348032","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:49:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112254868823871906"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/EHyFCEaWWg","end":146,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/CausMoney/status/2112254868823871906/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112254865946611712","start":123,"url":"https://t.co/EHyFCEaWWg"}]},"id":"2112254868823871906","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1430,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国大陆央行拟将主要政策利率改为隔夜利率，推动贷款定价改革\n\n中国大陆人民银行行长潘功胜10月19日在北京举行的2026金融街论坛年会上表示，央行正在研究将公开市场操作的主要期限从七天调整为隔夜，届时公开市场隔夜回购利率将成为中国主要政策利率。 https://t.co/EHyFCEaWWg","url":"https://x.com/CausMoney/status/2112254868823871906"},{"author_id":"2013688467142606848","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:34:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112387005497725003"],"id":"2112387005497725003","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":36,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Çin Merkez Bankası Faiz Kararı\n\n🔹 Çin Merkez Bankası, 1 yıllık kredi ana faiz oranını LPR beklentilere paralel şekilde %3,00 seviyesinde sabit tuttu.\n\n🔹 Konut kredileri açısından referans niteliğindeki 5 yıllık LPR de beklentilere paralel %3,50 seviyesinde değişmedi.\n\n🔹 PBoC","url":"https://x.com/traderselman/status/2112387005497725003"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2112398989064855552"]},"author_id":"2095760865232560128","created_at":"2026-10-20T04:22:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112399136276558197"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/n7kARVNMkT","end":249,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/LSN_NEWS_WORLD/status/2112399136276558197/video/1","media_key":"13_2112398989064855552","start":226,"url":"https://t.co/n7kARVNMkT"}]},"id":"2112399136276558197","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_c