KEY LENDING RATES UNCHANGED.\n\n1-year LPR: 3.00%\n5-year LPR: 3.50%\n\nWith Q3 growth at 4.5%, Beijing appears in no rush to deliver another rate cut.\n\n#China #PBOC #InterestRates #ChineseEconomy #AsianMarkets #GlobalFinance #Stocks #Economics","url":"https://x.com/Investwithkabir/status/2112518848037687672"},{"author_id":"2060789021463478273","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:00:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112378334474846503"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":199,"start":194,"tag":"PBOC"},{"end":206,"start":200,"tag":"China"},{"end":212,"start":207,"tag":"Yuan"},{"end":218,"start":213,"tag":"Farm"},{"end":230,"start":219,"tag":"tradingbot"}]},"id":"2112378334474846503","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"PBOC held 1Y/5Y LPR at 3.00%/3.50% and set the yuan fix at its strongest since Feb 2023. China's 9-month trade surplus hit a record $938B. Trump unveils $8B farm fuel aid.\n\nSentiment - Bullish\n\n#PBOC #China #Yuan #Farm #tradingbot","url":"https://x.com/NightOwlTrade/status/2112378334474846503"},{"author_id":"3137643480","created_at":"2026-10-20T10:41:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112494345303801928"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":10,"start":0,"tag":"גירויסיני"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/LiveSquawk/sta…","end":294,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/LiveSquawk/status/2112348281682726982","start":271,"url":"https://t.co/ulo4Yx5U3D"}]},"id":"2112494345303801928","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":327,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#גירויסיני ריבית פריים אוקטובר: \nסין שמרה על ריביות הפריים על הלוואות במשך החודש ה-17, כאשר המדיניות עוברת לריביות לטווח קצר\nריבית רוורס ריפו ל - 7 ימים של PBOC, שעומדת על 1.4%, היא ריבית המדיניות העיקרית מאז 2024, כשהריבית LPR הולכת בעקבותיה במקום לשמש כמנוף בפני עצמו. https://t.co/ulo4Yx5U3D","url":"https://x.com/TheRealYield/status/2112494345303801928"},{"author_id":"53188164","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112556711374368908"],"id":"2112556711374368908","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"China's central bank held loan rates steady for the 17th month: 1-yr LPR 3.00%, 5-yr 3.50%. Plain-language take: after Q3 GDP beat at 4.5%, Beijing feels no urgency to cut. The 5-yr rate anchors mortgages, so holding it = no new push for the housing market for now. Instead, the","url":"https://x.com/TXPOTATO/status/2112556711374368908"},{"author_id":"1244266306485932034","created_at":"2026-10-20T01:25:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112354495401508909"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":150,"start":143,"tag":"SHCOMP"},{"end":156,"start":151,"tag":"SSEC"},{"end":162,"start":157,"tag":"ASHR"},{"end":220,"start":215,"tag":"KWEB"},{"end":225,"start":221,"tag":"FXI"},{"end":230,"start":226,"tag":"HXC"},{"end":236,"start":231,"tag":"DRAG"},{"end":242,"start":237,"tag":"YINN"},{"end":248,"start":243,"tag":"YANG"}],"hashtags":[{"end":142,"start":136,"tag":"CHINA"},{"end":261,"start":249,"tag":"STOCKMARKET"}]},"id":"2112354495401508909","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":8510,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"🇨🇳LPR unchanged in October\nThe PBOC left the one-year and five-year loan prime rates (LPR) unchanged at 3.00% and 3.50%, respectively.  #CHINA $SHCOMP $SSEC $ASHR solana:3aSu9uuDLiWkBQGycJDDSubZEPb6YJjDzULPWZkJn8ic $KWEB $FXI $HXC $DRAG $YINN $YANG #STOCKMARKET","url":"https://x.com/Sino_Market/status/2112354495401508909"},{"author_id":"364720480","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:03:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112379042980933962"],"id":"2112379042980933962","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":124,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"El LPR de China quedó sin cambios en octubre: el PBOC mantuvo las tasas de referencia a un año y a cinco años en 3,00% y 3,50% respectivamente.","url":"https://x.com/cacus/status/2112379042980933962"},{"author_id":"2009430739096584192","created_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112611623978651722"],"id":"2112611623978651722","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The PBOC held the LPR for a 17th straight month. But overnight repo averages about 1.25%, 15bp below the 1.40% seven-day rate. Making it the main policy rate would formalize easing without a headline cut. PPI at 5.0% does not change that. CPI is 0.9%.","url":"https://x.com/macro_soup/status/2112611623978651722"},{"author_id":"1883321599153373185","created_at":"2026-10-20T04:25:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112399781439869085"],"id":"2112399781439869085","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🇨🇳 CHINA'S CENTRAL BANK\n🏦 The People's Bank of China left its loan prime rates unchanged today.\n🇨🇳 1-year LPR: 3.00%.\n🇨🇳 5-year LPR: 3.50%.\n📌 The decision is in line with market expectations.\n📈 China's economy grew 4.5% year-on-year in the third quarter.\n📉 However, weakness","url":"https://x.com/pipmoment/status/2112399781439869085"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112393146726486017","3_2112393148710457344","3_2112393152724357120"]},"author_id":"1409680454949609474","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:59:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112393154938958219"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/KpdQ8gcMgD","end":249,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/FxGecko_Global/status/2112393154938958219/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112393146726486017","start":226,"url":"https://t.co/KpdQ8gcMgD"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/KpdQ8gcMgD","end":249,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/FxGecko_Global/status/2112393154938958219/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112393148710457344","start